  "description": "Angular (15+) component for Brazilian boleto ITF barcodes (Interleaved 2 of 5 / Febraban). Encodes an even-length digit string for BarcodeInterleaved2of5. Not EAN, UPC, Code 128, or a linha digitável converter.",
